🩺 Project Name: SARTHI
Smart Assistance for Real-Time Healthcare Interaction
🎯 Objective:

Nearby hospitals aur patients ke beech ek real-time digital bridge banana — taaki dawa, appointment, report, aur emergency madad sab timely mil sakein.

🧩 Main Features (Prototype Level)
1. Hospital Locator

GPS-based nearby hospital finder.

Hospital type (govt/private, specialization) filter.

Distance, estimated time to reach, contact info.

2. Medicine Reminder & Delivery

User apni prescribed medicines add kare.

App unhe time-to-time notification de (reminder).

Optional: Nearby pharmacy se home delivery integration.

3. Doctor Appointment Scheduler

Hospital ke available doctors ka real-time schedule.

Direct appointment booking.

Confirmation & token system (QR-based entry).

4. Emergency Help

One-tap emergency call (nearest hospital/ambulance).

Live location tracking for ambulance dispatch.

SOS message to family contacts.

5. Patient Record Management

Cloud-based health records (reports, prescriptions).

Doctor–patient easy access with permission control.

🧠 Technology Stack (Prototype Suggestion)
Component	Technology Suggestion
Frontend (App)	Flutter / React Native
Backend	Node.js + Express
Database	Firebase / MongoDB
APIs	Google Maps API (for hospital location), Twilio (for SMS alerts)
Authentication	Firebase Auth / OAuth
Hosting	AWS / Firebase Hosting
💡 Prototype Flow (User Journey)

User app open karta hai → location permission deta hai.

App nearby hospitals list karta hai.

User select karta hai → appointment ya medicine reminder set karta hai.

Backend reminder trigger karta hai (notification / SMS).

In emergency → SOS button → nearest ambulance ko alert.